@startuml
class Student {
  +studentId: String
  +name: String
}

class Room {
  +roomId: String
  +name: String
  +blocked: Boolean
  +block()
  +unblock()
}

class Booking {
  +bookingId: String
  +start: DateTime
  +end: DateTime
  +status: String
  +cancel()
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : is reserved by

note right of Booking
  R1: start is in the future and duration is greater than 0
  and at most 2 hours.
  R2: active bookings for the same room cannot overlap.
end note

note right of Room
  R3: a blocked room cannot accept a new booking.
end note
@enduml
